WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
{Ending}

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:06.460
<i>{emo}There's no way I could've known about this ending.</i>

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.110
Shit! The head! Aim for the head!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.110
Dammit! Who the hell let these things on?!

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.370
The First Lady has been bitten!

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.260
Mr. President! Please enter the code!

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.210
But...

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.500
You and I have both been bitten!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.350
Please listen.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:33.110
We don't even have anywhere to land!

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:40.470
This is why we must suppress every country that is pointing ICBM's at the USA while we still can!

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:46.030
Aside from officially announcing National State of Emergency Tactical Regulation 666D,

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:51.130
we have no way of fulfilling our duty to both the constitution and the people!

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.170
Mr. Chairman!

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.800
I'm done for.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.710
Someone, please...

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.300
Yes sir!

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.130
Mr. President...

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.260
The code...

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:19.770
God... bless...{both lines w/the pause too}

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:13.290
Yureta Genjitsukan Nakushita Mama de

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:13.290
As I lose my shaky touch with reality,

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:18.340
Gareki no Youni Tsumikasanaru

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:18.340
my emotions pile up like fallen debris

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:22.620
Kono Kanshou wa Doko e Yuku

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:22.620
Where do they think they're going?

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.890
Tsuieta Kibou Kakae

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.890
With my crushed hope in tow,

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:32.850
Akai Ame o Harai Hashitta Muchuu ni

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:32.850
I frantically ran straight through the bloody rain

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:39.510
Kuzureta Kanjou no Hate ni

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:39.510
After my emotions come spilling out,

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.810
Nani o Miru

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.810
what will I see?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.080
Nani ga Aru

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.080
What will I have?

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.760
Mada Shiranai

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.760
I still don't know

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:49.640
Hakanai Subete no Mirai wa

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:49.640
But in this silence,

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.210
Tada Muon ni Me no Mae ni

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.210
all of the fragile outcomes

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:59.220
Hirogari Tsudzuketa

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:59.220
lie endlessly before me

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:15.670
Row, row, row your boat

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.560
La la la la

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.470
Gently down the stream

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:27.350
Row, row, row your boat

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.480
La la la la

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.480
Gently down the stream

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.310
I can even sing in English.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.910
Wow! Try singing it.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.590
Okay, this time, I'll sing a parody.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:52.210
Okay.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.550
Wow Kohta!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.220
Hey, fatty!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.690
Don't teach kids inappropriate songs!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:14.600
That song is from Mother Goose, you know!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.900
Kaaay.{added}

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.340
Guys, wake up!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.780
It's about time we crossed the river.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.590
There's no one here.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.320
Living or otherwise.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.890
What?!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.780
I bet you're enjoying that.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.570
What? Huh?

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.000
Uhm, Saeko.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.280
You're drooling.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.460
Let's get out.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:07.710
Why?

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:10.410
Er, well, the sun is up.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.160
I thought you'd wanna get changed...

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.100
Komuro, come help me.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.920
Let's get Alice down.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.700
Uhm... Uhm...

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.300
My undies...

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:32.240
This is why men...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.310
Look, we're going to be changing, so don't you dare look over here!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.280
So, she's...?

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.000
Alice Maresato.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.650
She's a 2nd grade student.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.850
Her father is a newspaper reporter.

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:48.310
Er, rather, he was.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:50.550
What about her mother?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.680
Her father said they'd meet up with her later.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.610
I brought my friend's clothes with us.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.540
You can wear whatever you like.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.360
Can I wear this jacket?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.460
Of course!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.880
Are there no other skirts besides this one?

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.850
Isn't it sexy?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.070
Time to take one for the team, Komuro!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.940
I said I don't wanna die!

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.350
He's always so hyper.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:22.390
Hey, don't bark too much, Zeke.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.440
Zeke?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.270
That's his name.

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:29.590
Zeke was the nickname the American army gave the Reisen during the Pacific War.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:30.670
Reisen?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.180
Oh, the Zero fighter plane.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:35.840
You really are small and fast. It's a fitting name.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.190
Use this, Komuro.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:41.590
It's a shotgun, so just aim for the head.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:44.330
Like I said before, I don't know how to use it.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.800
I'd be better off with a bat.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.180
After you shove the shotshells in,

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:55.500
get your target in sight, press the trigger, and blow off their head.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.170
Just stick to hitting things that're nearby since you haven't had any practice.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.530
What do I do when I run out?

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.700
Open the gate like this

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.580
and push them in like so.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.020
Normally, it holds four shells plus one shell in the chamber.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.100
Only five total can be in at a time, so use them wisely.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.970
Aside from that, another peculiar thing about this gun is—

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.290
I'll need to hear it more than once to understand.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.690
But you should keep in mind that the recoil is strong.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.290
If I have to, I'll use it like a bat.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.250
This is to help you survive!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:26.950
I know.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.410
<i>Onii-chan!</i>

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.570
What's up?

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.870
What? Gotta problem?

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.480
No, you look good.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.060
But uh, do you know how to fire that thing?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.110
Hirano can teach me.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.080
If I have to, I'll use it like a spear.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.100
Youcanyoucanyoucan!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.460
We have a military-use bayonet device!

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:06.370
We're going up in the Humvee!

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.050
You two men, go see if it's safe!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.510
YES MA'AM!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:20.720
Clear.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:22.690
It's okay!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.400
Ms. Shizuka.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.440
Here we go!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.530
The Rat Patrooo—

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.480
Is this Tunisia?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.790
It doesn't look like they tried to block the river.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.120
As the news broadcast said, it is like this all throughout the world.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.320
But I'm sure there are some police officers left.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:59.650
Right. Japan's police officers are all about their work.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.660
Yeah!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.440
What do we do now?

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.610
Takagi, aren't you from Higashisaka 2-chome?

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:07.800
Yeah.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:11.230
Then Takagi's house is the closest.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:14.430
But, uhm...

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.900
Yeah, I know...

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.360
I'm not expecting anything.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:19.930
But, I still want to...

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.200
Of course you do.

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.490
There's so many big bikes!

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.560
They sell stuff like imported buggies there.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.960
Some of them were trashed by the military.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.490
Why do you know all of this?

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.620
What's wrong?

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.330
We haven't seen any helicopters or airplanes.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.550
But yesterday, we saw so many of them.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:04.380
Everything will be all right, won't it?{re-interpret?}

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.130
Yeah, definitely.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.490
Hey, Takashi. Did you notice?

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.590
Notice what?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.210
We...

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.330
We haven't seen any of them today.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.190
That's true.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:59.510
It's them!

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:03.310
Ahead and to the right! Distance: 300!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.380
Turn right!

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.890
Okay!

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.530
They're here too! Jeez!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.040
Then turn left! Left!

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.880
What the...

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.390
We're seeing more and more of them as we get closer to Higashisaka 2-chome.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:23.160
But why? There must be a reason why!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.140
Keep up the speed and push them aside!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.080
No!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.100
Don't!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.750
Stop!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.610
A wire is affixed to the walls!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.180
Turn the car to the side!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:47.910
Don't look!

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.680
Why won't it stop?!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.990
Lock the tires!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.810
Just ease up a little on the brake and step on the gas!

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.410
Lock?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.160
Hey teach!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.660
Up front! The front!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.340
Open the slide...

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.280
Aim for the head...

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.370
Takashi?

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:53.680
And fire!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:01.070
What? But I aimed for the head!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.610
I didn't hit many of them!

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.040
You're a lousy shot!

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.080
The recoil's raising your muzzle and your fire pattern's slipping upwards!

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.110
Hold the gun straight and aim at their chest!

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.930
Hold the gun straight...

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.480
Aim at their chest...

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.600
And fire!

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:20.640
Woah, cool.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.680
But there's too many of them...

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.490
After firing a shot,

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.950
leave the trigger and just open the slide!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.550
The muzzle shifts a little!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.390
This owns!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.050
Crap, bullets!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.920
Shit!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.140
Komuro!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.840
I shall assist you!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.110
Take this opportunity to rescue Miyamoto!

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:51.310
No way!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.120
There's too many of them for you to fight with a wooden sword!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.950
I know that!

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.680
Dammit!

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.040
Well, at least we can die together.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.750
Takashi?

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:30.760
I got it...

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:32.150
Sorry!

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.320
Hirano! How do I use this?

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:38.430
Push the lever in front of the trigger guard!

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.090
Then disengage the safety!

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.240
After, pull the operating rod on the right side!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.620
And shoot!

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.490
Missed!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.660
Missed!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.520
Missed!

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:29.100
My magazine!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.240
Someone get me one of these from the back!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.320
Kohta?

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:34.490
This!

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.820
Kohta!

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.750
Here!

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:48.510
Time to kill!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.640
I'll kill 'em all!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:58.420
What the? The engine's stalled and I can't start it!

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:01.110
What're you doing, Takagi?!

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:03.690
I'm going to pick up Komuro's gun and use it!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.490
T-That's dangerous!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.490
Yes, I know.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.870
Takagi!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:14.540
The bullets are by your feet! Do you know how to use it?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.460
I'm a genius!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:17.540
Takagi?

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.350
In the future, call me by my first name!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.730
I'm... not a coward!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:36.150
I'm not a coward!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.900
I'm not gonna die!

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.360
None of us are gonna die here!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:46.990
My house is just around the corner!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.600
Zeke!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:46.920
Komuro!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.530
Come on. Let a man do his thing.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.790
What're you going to do?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.760
Copy Zeke.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.160
Come with me, Komuro!

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:22.740
Here!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:23.960
Here!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.130
Over here!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.080
Komuro!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.240
Up here!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.260
Come on! We're right here!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.950
Hurry up and follow us!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.480
They are still...?

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.650
I SAID COME OVER HERE!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.950
Here you go.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.370
Kohta...

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.540
You and Zeke need to jump to the other side of the wire!

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:07.000
But what about everyone else?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.890
We'll be there shortly!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.340
Liar.

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:11.180
Huh?

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.620
You have the same face my daddy had when he died!

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:18.470
He died even though he said he was okay!

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:21.330
No! No! No!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.220
I don't wanna be alone!

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:27.470
I wanna be with you and
Takashi and the girls forever!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:30.350
Forever and ever and ever!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.610
Don't leave me alone!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:33.990
Please!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:40.370
Please!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.190
Take me high

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.270
Floating like a kite

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.580
Gently make me free

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.920
Holding a thousand dreams

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:25.020
Nagareru Kumo wa Ne Doko e Yuku no

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:25.020
Hey, where are the clouds drifting to?

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.230
What do you want?

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.760
What do you see?

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.450
Mirai wa

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.450
The future

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.850
Sono Mama Taiyo Sae

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.850
As things are, even the sun

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:35.260
Nomikonde Shimau Kedo

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:35.260
will be get swallowed up

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.780
Demo Kamawanai

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.780
But that doesn't bother me

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:43.900
'Cause we will be there again

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:49.610
I'll always be with you

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.920
No! No! No!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.800
Don't leave me alone!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:18.510
Please!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:20.550
Please!

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.460
Everyone, duck!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:44.160
They're... saved...

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:47.920
Come this way immediately.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:50.150
You can pick up that car later.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:55.600
Who are they?

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:58.340
I do not believe they are really from the fire department.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:03.350
Thanks for rescuing us when we were in danger!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:05.270
It's only natural...

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:13.610
For a mother to help her daughter and her friends.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:15.000
Mom!

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:23.490
That's Takagi's mom!

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:25.370
They're saved!

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:29.830
Our situation, on the other hand, does not bode well.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:32.020
I do not believe they will come help us.

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:35.340
Let's take a detour. I know my way around this area.

00:22:36.690 --> 00:22:37.930
Takashi...

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:42.810
Kohta?

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.720
Don't worry.

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:49.230
Busujima-<i>sempai</i>  is strong and Komuro is one stubborn guy.

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:54.060
We'll be waiting!

00:22:54.620 --> 00:23:01.390
We'll be waiting at my house!

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:08.160
<i>{emo}Despite the situation we found ourselves in,</i>

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:12.060
<i>{emo}I kept my head held high.</i>

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:16.450
<i>{emo}Because after all of the fights and fighting,</i>

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:20.440
<i>{emo}we were still alive.</i>

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:26.080
Let's get back.

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:28.130
I... I am a girl!

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.130
Uh, yes!

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:31.560
There is a man I like.

00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:33.540
Saeko!

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:34.960
Of course!
